# Create Data URL

Fetches a remote asset through the current transport and returns it as a `data:` URL. Useful for proxied tab favicons and autocomplete images. Returns `undefined` if the request fails.

```svelte
<script>
  import Chemical from "chemicaljs/Chemical";

  let chemical = $state();
  let ready = $state(false);

  async function generateIcon() {
    if (!ready) return;
    const icon = await chemical.createDataURL("https://www.google.com/favicon.ico");
    console.log(icon);
  }
</script>

<Chemical bind:ready bind:this={chemical} />
```
